ormance.</li><li>Energy Efficient &amp; Reliable – Wide power input (100-240V AC) and industrial-grade durability.</li></ul><p><br></p><h4>Benefits for ISPs &amp; Enterprises:</h4><p><br></p><ul><li>Scalable EPON OLT for FTTH/FTTB broadband deployment.</li><li>Cost-effective solution for triple-play services (Internet, IPTV, VoIP).</li><li>Compatible with most industry ONUs, ensuring easy integration.</li><li>Optimized for high-density user environments with stable performance.</li></ul><p><br></p><h4>Technical Specifications:</h4><p><br></p><ul><li>Model: HSGQ-XE04R</li><li>PON Ports: 4 × EPON SFP slots</li><li>Uplink Ports: 4 × GE RJ45 + 4 × 10G SFP+</li><li>Max ONUs: 256 (1:64 split ratio per port)</li><li>Memory: 512MB DDR, 32MB Flash</li><li>Dimensions: 442 × 260 × 44 mm (1U)</li><li>Operating Temp.: –10°C ~ 60°C</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"VSOL V1600D4-DP EPON OLT 4 PORT 10G UPLINK","href":"/vsol-v1600d4-dp-epon-olt-4-port-10g-uplink","now":"43,000৳","old":"48,000৳","single":""},{"name":"ECOM E08EP-4S+ 8-Port EPON OLT Without 4 PON Card","href":"/ecom-e08ep-4s-8-port-epon-olt-without-4-pon-card","now":"39,500৳","old":"42,000৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V1600D8 8-Port EPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600d8-8-port-epon-olt","now":"75,000৳","old":"76,500৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V1601E02-DP 2Port EPON OLT 10G UPLINK","href":"/V.SOL%20V1601E02-DP%202Port%20EPON%20OLT","now":"31,500৳","old":"36,000৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V1600D16 16-Port EPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600d16-16-port-epon-olt","now":"150,000৳","old":"155,000৳","single":""},{"name":"ECOM E08EP-4S+ 8 Port EPON OLT With 8 PON Card","href":"/ecom-e08ep-4s-8-port-epon-olt-with-8-pon-card","now":"59,000৳","old":"65,000৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V3600D8 8 Port 10G 1:256 Ratio EPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v3600d8-8-port-10g-1256-ratio-epon-olt","now":"345,000৳","ol